  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **ween.2004-04-30** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 122 min [1]\n- **Ween2004-04-30**: source not stated; 25 songs; 122 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ween played as the opening act for Medeski Martin & Wood [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween.2004-04-30**: taped by Matt \"Lazy Lightning\" Lazor; transferred by DiGiHoArDeRs; source: Neumann KM140s(ORTF/FOB/DFC)-> V2-> SBM1-> D8 [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann KM140 microphones in ORTF/FOB/DFC placement, then through a V2 and SBM1 to D8 DAT; Transferred from DAT via Tascam DA-20 MKII and SPDIF into a Mac Mini using Audacity, then encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **Ween2004-04-30**: Audience recording from front center of the first balcony; taper unknown; passed through CDR, EAC and FLAC [2]",
